      "title": "My First Part-Time Job",
      "text": "Last summer, I decided to look for a part-time job to earn some extra money. I found an advertisement in the local newspaper for a shop assistant in a small bakery. I had (1) _______ worked in a shop before, so I was a little nervous during the interview. However, the manager was very kind and offered me the job immediately. My main duties included serving customers and keeping the shop clean. I usually worked (2) _______ Saturday mornings from eight until midday. It was hard work, but I enjoyed (3) _______ time with my colleagues. One of the best things about the job was the free bread I could take home (4) _______ the end of my shift. I learned a lot about responsibility and how to talk to people. I think (5) _______ student should try to get a part-time job because it is a great way to gain experience. I am definitely going to look for (6) _______ job next summer too.",
